   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "AUDIO MIX\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 10, CC 65 to 80\n   1 Music under speech\n   2 Audio fades\n   3 Voice effect\n   4 Edited-in sound hits\n   5 Loudness\n   6 Voice-over\n   7 Translated voice\n   8 Voice cleanup\n   9 Music sting\n  10 Sound roles\n  11 pair: When the joke pays off, a sound hit lands\n  12 pair: When the clip slows down, the music rises\n  13 pair: When the clip rewinds, a sound hit plays\n  14 pair: When a cutaway covers the talking, the music sits under\n  15 pair: When a scene ends on a button joke, a sting hits\n  16 pair: When the joke pays off, a music sting lands\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 10, CC 81 to 82\n   1 pair: When the multicam switches on the speaker, dialogue leads the mix\n   2 pair: When a running montage rides above the story, the music leads"
   },
   "pos": [
